	(text "RTC6705 can modulate two audio subcarriers, 6.0 MHz and 6.5 MHz; the RTC6715 demods both. Pick the one your TX uses:\n\n6.0 MHz path: take AUOUT6 (pin 26)\n\n6.5 MHz path: take AUOUT_65 (pin 28)\nThese are line-level signals; route through a coupling cap (e.g., 1 µF) into a small amp (e.g., PAM8403) → speakers/headphones."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 620.014 335.788 0)
		(effects
			(font
