	(text "Practical, safe rules\n\nWithin the RGB bus (R/G/B data lines): keep trace lengths matched within ±10 mm (±0.4″).\n\nData vs DCLK (the only one that really matters): keep each data line within ±20 mm of DCLK length.\n\nHS/VS/DE vs DCLK: treat like data; ±20 mm is plenty."
